				<r3d:description language="eng">CaltechDATA is an institutional data repository for Caltech.  Caltech library runs the repository to preserve the accomplishments of Caltech researchers and share their results with the world.  Caltech-associated researchers can upload data, link data with their publications, and assign a permanent DOI so that others can reference the data set.  The repository also preserves software and has automatic Github integration. All files present in the repository are open access or embargoed, and all metadata is always available to the public.</r3d:description>
